:{"start":{"line":32,"column":50,"offset":1387},"end":{"line":32,"column":66,"offset":1403}}},{"type":"text","value":" :","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":66,"offset":1403},"end":{"line":32,"column":68,"offset":1405}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1,"offset":1338},"end":{"line":32,"column":69,"offset":1406}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"thaw_account(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        ThawAccount {\r\n            account: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            mint: ctx.accounts.mint.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1,"offset":1410},"end":{"line":45,"column":4,"offset":1752}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":45,"column":4,"offset":1752}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Instructions Freeze et Thaw\r\n\r\n`Freeze` empêche toutes les opérations liées aux jetons sur un compte jusqu'à ce qu'il soit débloqué. Seule l'autorité de gel du mint peut effectuer cette opération.\r\n\r\n> Désactive complètement les transferts, les approbations et les *burn*. Cela n'affecte que le compte gelé concerné\r\n\r\n`Thaw` réactive les opérations liées aux jetons sur un compte précédemment gelé. Seule l'autorité de gel du mint peut débloquer des comptes.\r\n\r\n> Restaure toutes les fonctionnalités du compte gelé. Ne peut être effectuée que par l'autorité de gel du mint\r\n\r\nAvant de pouvoir geler et débloquer un jeton, nous devons déjà avoir :\r\n- Initialisé un compte de `Mint` pour lequel nous détenons la `freezeAuthority`\r\n- Initialisé un compte de `Token` ou `Associated Token` que nous voulons geler ou débloquer\r\n\r\nVoici à quoi ressemble le CPI à l'instruction `freeze_account()` : \r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfreeze_account(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        FreezeAccount {\r\n            account: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            mint: ctx.accounts.mint.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;\r\n```\r\n\r\nEt voici à quoi ressemble le CPI à l'instruction `thaw_account()` : \r\n\r\n```rust\r\nthaw_account(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        ThawAccount {\r\n            account: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            mint: ctx.accounts.mint.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"freeze_account"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"("}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    CpiContext"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"new"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","v